{"3457490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Senet: Households", "steam_appid": 3457490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROVE YOU'RE BLESSED BY THE GODS</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play an Ancient Egyptian board game. </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play against your friends on steam. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new ways to play with -never seen before- special house rules. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize the rules to your liking. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a story where you travel through ancient Egypt. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All environments are fact checked by professionals. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Senet Households is a free to play digital adaptation of the Ancient Egyptian Strategy Board game senet. Senet households adds to the base rules of senet with special house rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also brings 3 different historically accurate environments of an Ancient Egyptian farm an Ancient Egyptian festival and an Ancient Egyptian Palace based on the Amenhotep III Palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every environment has it's own character with an Ancient Egyptian Farmer's Child, An Ancient Egyptian Priest and An Ancient Egyptian Pharaoh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROVE YOU'RE BLESSED BY THE GODS</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play an Ancient Egyptian board game. </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play against your friends on steam. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new ways to play with -never seen before- special house rules. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize the rules to your liking. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a story where you travel through ancient Egypt. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All environments are fact checked by professionals. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Senet Households is a free to play digital adaptation of the Ancient Egyptian Strategy Board game senet. Senet households adds to the base rules of senet with special house rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also brings 3 different historically accurate environments of an Ancient Egyptian farm an Ancient Egyptian festival and an Ancient Egyptian Palace based on the Amenhotep III Palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every environment has it's own character with an Ancient Egyptian Farmer's Child, An Ancient Egyptian Priest and An Ancient Egyptian Pharaoh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Prove you're blessed by the gods in this Online Multiplayer Ancient Egyptian Board Game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457490/header.jpg?t=1738242053", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457490/9714ec3b5d9a4c90765a3529c05eded085be47f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738242053", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457490/9714ec3b5d9a4c90765a3529c05eded085be47f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738242053", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan-compatible GPU with 2GB VRAM (e.g., NVIDIA GTX 75